{"pin":"AB10701","subcodes":[{"code":"AB10701","anchor":"","first_line":"O Lord! Make these children excellent plants. Let them grow and develop in the garden of Thy Covenant… O Thou kind Lord! I am a little chlid\"","first_line_orig":"پروردگارا این اطفال را نهالهای بیهمال کن و در حدیقه میثاق نشو و نما بخش  ","language":"Per","word_count":"60","full_text_parts":["O Lord!  Make these children excellent plants.  Let them grow and develop in the Garden of Thy Covenant, and bestow freshness and beauty through the outpourings from the clouds of the all-glorious Kingdom.\nO Thou kind Lord!  I am a little child, exalt me by admitting me to the kingdom.  I am earthly, make me heavenly; I am of the world below, let me belong to the realm above; gloomy, suffer me to become radiant; material, make me spiritual, and grant that I may manifest Thine infinite bounties.\nThou art the Powerful, the All-Loving."],"translations":[{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"sq","lang_name":"Albanian"},{"language":"hy","lang_name":"Armenian"},{"language":"bs","lang_name":"Bosnian"},{"language":"ur","lang_name":"Urdu"},{"language":"lv","lang_name":"Latvian"},{"language":"fr","lang_name":"French"},{"language":"sk","lang_name":"Slovak"},{"language":"th","lang_name":"Thai"},{"language":"sv","lang_name":"Swedish"},{"language":"is","lang_name":"Icelandic"},{"language":"ja","lang_name":"Japanese"},{"language":"ta","lang_name":"Tamil"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"kn","lang_name":"Kannada"},{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"mh","lang_name":"Marshallese"},{"language":"zh-Hans","lang_name":"Simplified Chinese"},{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"language":"mi","lang_name":"Maori"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"sne","lang_name":"Bau Bidayuh"},{"language":"tl","lang_name":"Tagalog"},{"language":"zh-Hant","lang_name":"Traditional Chinese"},{"language":"ht","lang_name":"Haitian Creo